      "field": "description",
      "before": "<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Feature</th>\n<th>Details</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Product Name</td>\n<td>2.4GHz R/C Spray Bumper Cars Set (2 Cars)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Brand / Series</td>\n<td>RC Bump Car – 2.4GHz Remote Control</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Recommended Age</td>\n<td>3+ Ages</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Main Components</td>\n<td>Two blue bumper cars with driver figures and remote controllers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Included Accessories</td>\n<td>Dual handheld controllers, spray feature, lights, and sound effects</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Skill Development</td>\n<td>Develops directional control, reflexes, and multiplayer coordination</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Play Purpose</td>\n<td>Remote-controlled bumper car battle and racing play</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
      "after": "<p>Two blue bumper cars with drivers, each with its own 2.4GHz controller, for head-to-head battles. This bumper car toy remote control set has mist spray, lights and sound effects.</p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;\">\n<thead><tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#f6f6f6;width:35%;\">Feature</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#f6f6f6;\">Details</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #ddd;vertical-align:top;\"><strong>Product Type</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">Remote control bumper cars (set of 2)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #ddd;vertical-align:top;\"><strong>Recommended Age</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">3 years and up</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #ddd;vertical-align:top;\"><strong>Control</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">2.4GHz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #ddd;vertical-align:top;\"><strong>Includes</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">2 bumper cars with driver figures, 2 controllers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #ddd;vertical-align:top;\"><strong>Features</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">Spray, lights, sound</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #ddd;vertical-align:top;\"><strong>Colour</strong></td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #ddd;\">Blue</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Complete the look with picks from our <a href=\"/collections/remote-control-cars\">remote control cars</a> and <a href=\"/collections/remote-control-toys\">remote control toys</a>.</p>\n<p><em>Disclaimer: Actual colour may vary slightly due to studio lighting and screen settings.</em></p>"
